[38;2;124;124;124mWe have $S = K[[S_1, \ldots, S_n]]$ (a formal power series ring over a field $K$[0m[38;2;124;124;124min variables $S_1, \ldots, S_n$), and elements $f_1, \ldots, f_d \in S[[X_1, [0m
